*dest = *extent`\n    // — :810-816. Split into two assignments because Model T's arms are\n    // distinct fields; the branch structure is the C's.\n    if map.nr_extents < UID_GID_MAP_MAX_BASE_EXTENTS as u32 {\n        map.extent[map.nr_extents as usize] = *extent;\n    } else {\n        map.forward[map.nr_extents as usize] = *extent;\n    }\n\n    map.nr_extents += 1;\n    return 0;\n}","attr_info":{"attributes":[{"DocComment":" `insert_extent`, kernel/user_namespace.c:789-820."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" This is the function Model T exists for: at `nr_extents == 5` the C"},{"DocComment":" installs the two heap pointers over the first 16 bytes of the union,"},{"DocComment":" which destroys `extent[0]` entirely and `extent[1].first`. That write is"},{"DocComment":" reproduced below, so that \"no read ever observes a clobbered slot\" is"},{"DocComment":" theorem S5 (`NO-STALE-READ`) rather than assumption `A-UNION`."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" DEVIATION: the C's `-ENOMEM` path (:798) is unreachable here because the"},{"DocComment":" 340-slot array is always present. Returns 0 always; the signature keeps"},{"DocComment":" the `int` return so the call site in `map_write` stays recognizable."}],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":true},"is_local":true,"opacity":"Transparent","lang_item":null},"generics":{"regions":[{"index":0,"name":null,"mutability":"Unknown"},{"index":1,"name":null,"mutability":"Unknown"}],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_clauses":[],"regions_outlive":[],"types_outlive":[],"trait_type_constraints":[]},"signature":{"is_unsafe":false,"abi":"Rust","is_variadic":false,"inputs":[{"HashConsedValue":[966,{"Ref":[{"Var":{"Free":0}},{"Deduplicated":576},"Mut"]}]},{"HashConsedValue":[967,{"Ref":[{"Var":{"Free":1}},{"Deduplicated":448},"Shared"]}]}],"output":{"Deduplicated":590}},"src":"TopLevel","is_global_initializer":null,"body":{"Structured":{"span":{"data":{"file_id":0,"beg":{"line":421,"col":0},"end":{"line":459,"col":1}},"generated